It is a direct port of the opencode plugin for Claude Code
(https://github.com/handong66/opencode-plugin-cc), which is itself derived from
that Codex plugin. The command surface, the three-outcome run classification,
the job-store design and the per-workspace state layout come from that lineage.

The runtime implementation targets the Antigravity CLI's headless print mode
(https://antigravity.google) and was written for this project. Antigravity and
the `agy` CLI are products of Google; this project is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or supported by Google, OpenAI, or Anomaly Innovations.
